<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">Subs := seq(u(t+s, x+jj*h) = phi[j+jj], jj = -1..1), seq(u(t, x+jj*h) = psi[j+jj], jj = -1..1);
stencil[2] := expand(isolate(subs(Subs, stencil[2]), phi));
master_CN := unapply(stencil[2], phi, psi, d, s, h, j);</Text-field>
